# Day 100 Special Rules

1. This is the final celebration project - make it memorable and comprehensive
2. Showcase all 100 projects in an interactive gallery
3. Include celebration animations and effects
4. Provide multiple viewing modes (gallery, timeline, statistics)
5. Ensure smooth performance even with 100 project cards
6. Make the experience feel complete and satisfying
7. Include reflection on the journey
8. Optimize iframe loading for project previews
9. Add sharing functionality for social media
10. This project should feel like a graduation ceremony